----------- app code
Shoes.app(title: "White Circle",
  width: 200, height: 200, resizable: false) {
    background black
    fill white
    oval top: 20, left: 20, radius: 160
}
----------- test code
app = Shoes.APPS.first
assert_equal 200, app.width, "the window is 200 pixels wide"
assert_equal 200, app.height, "and 200 pixels high"
